  tags: ['mobile'],
  summary: 'Send an E2EE test notification to mobile device(s)',
  description:
    "Trigger sending an end-to-end encrypted (E2EE) test push notification\nto the user's selected mobile device or all of their mobile devices.\n\n**Changes**: New in Zulip 11.0 (feature level 420).\n",
  operationId: 'e2ee-test-notify',
